READ STATEMENT - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

              2         IDT  'READ'
              3  *
              4  *
              5  *
              6         REF  BMVE              ;MOVE BYTE
              7         REF  CKEX              ;CHECK FOR EXPRESSION
              8         REF  EVARZ             ;GET VARIABLE
              9         REF  EVERZ             ;EVALUATE EXPRESSION
             10         REF  EVSDZ             ;EVALUATE STRING
             11         REF  NLIN              ;EXIT TO MULTIPLEXOR
             12         REF  NLIN0             ;EXIT TO MULTIPLEXOR
             13         REF  REST              ;RESTORE DATA PTR
             14         REF  SFSN              ;SEARCH FOR STATEMENT NUMBER
             15         DXOP EVFIX,11          ;EVALUATE AND FIX
     2F80    16  ERROR  EQU  >2F80             ;XOP XX,14  (ERROR CALL)
             17  *
             18         REF  BUS               ;BEGINNING OF USER STORAGE
             19         REF  DATXB             ;DATA INTERNAL BYTE CODE
             20         REF  DDM               ;DATA DELIMITER
             21         REF  DLC               ;DATA LINE COUNTER
             22         REF  DLIM              ;LINE DELIMITER
             23         REF  SLT               ;STATEMENT LOCATION TABLE
             24         REF  LNSZ
             25         DEF  RDDY,RNWY
             26  *
             27  * ABSTRACT:
             28  *
             29  *       READ COMMAND USES FDATA TO PICK
             30  *       UP NEXT ITEM FROM DATA STATEMENTS.
             31  *       SINCE THE EVALUATOR IS USED, ANY
             32  *       EXPRESSION CAN APPEAR IN THE DATA
             33  *       STATEMENT.
             34  *
             35  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             36  *
             37  *       B @RDDY
             38  *       B @RNWY
             39  *
             40  *       EXIT TO NLIN
             41  *
             42  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
             43  *
             44  *       ERROR 24 FOR READING INTO STRING CONSTANT
             45  *       ERROR 23 FOR READ WITHOUT DATA
